Active [SimTalk] - Display
Activates the object designated by <Path> (true) or deactivates it (false).
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.Active:boolean
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type boolean.
Example
MyDisplay.active := true
See also
