Font [SimTalk] - Display
Sets the Font Size of the text and of the Comment, which the Display designated by <Path> displays in
Text mode in the Frame.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.Font:integer
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type integer.
You can specify 1 for Small, 2 for Medium, 3 for Large, 4 for Extra Large.
Example
MyDisplay.Font := 2
